# .review-tiers: copy to your repo root and edit. Unlisted paths need a person. `human` lines win over `agent`.
# See docs/REVIEW-TIERS.md.
default human

# Agents handle these end to end (the AI verifier is enough)
agent web/**
agent frontend/**
agent **/components/**
agent **/*.css
agent tests/**
agent **/test_*.py
agent **/*.test.*
agent **/*.spec.*
agent bench/**
agent benchmarks/**
agent docs/**
agent **/*.md

# Core: a person reads these before they merge
human **/auth*/**
human **/security/**
human **/migrations/**
human **/schema*
human **/billing/**
human **/payments/**
human infra/**
human terraform/**
human .github/**
human Dockerfile*
human **/*.sql

# An agent-tier file that starts using core code needs a person
escalate (import|from|require\().*\b(auth|db|database|secrets?|iam|billing|payments?)\b
escalate \b(SELECT|INSERT|UPDATE|DELETE)\b.*\b(FROM|INTO|SET)\b
